implementationPlan.description:
TESTS FIRST (skill test-driven-development). New apps/daemon/src/http/design-read.test.ts modelled on goal-source-read.test.ts.

Arms, each asserting code AND layer (CONTROL_ROOM_LISTENER for listener refusals; DesignRefusal.layer for store answers):
(1) no port -> LISTENER_DESIGN_UNAVAILABLE;
(2) non-GOAL principal -> capability denied (copy GOAL_SOURCE_READ_CAPABILITY_DENIED pattern or DESIGN_READ_CAPABILITY_DENIED if you add one — pick one and use it in production too);
(3) extra key / missing goalRef / non-string goalRef / payload projectId -> LISTENER_DESIGN_REQUEST_INVALID;
(4) `{goalRef}` with an injected port that returns DESIGN_REVISION_ABSENT -> that code AND LEDGER, httpStatus 200, no durable write;
(5) `{goalRef, version}` well-formed with an injected port backed by a REAL file-backed store (submit via submitDesignRevision then read) -> ok record plus versions list; a second submit yields version 2 and version 1 still readable;
(6) `{goalRef, version: 1}` after two submits returns version 1.

Also extend http-listener-read-dispatch.test.ts: JSON_ROUTES contains `/design/read`; UNCONSUMED_SERVED_ROUTES includes `/design/read` with a comment that the browser consumer is task-e9cb2442; do NOT add a proxy pin (UNPROXIED_SERVED_PATHS gets `/design/read` if the dispatch-vs-proxy arm would otherwise red).

Run `pnpm --filter @moe/daemon test` and quote the reds.

WIRE THE ROUTE, do not compose the production factory (task-eb2bb09d).

http-listener.ts: add optional `designReads?: DesignReadPort` on StartListenerOptions, same JSDoc as goalSource (absent => UNAVAILABLE).

http-listener-read-dispatch.ts (539 lines; add only):
- import DESIGN_READ_PATH and handleDesignReadRequest;
- JSON_ROUTES member `/design/read` (near the other /goals and /documents paths);
- POST guard: non-POST -> LISTENER_DESIGN_REQUEST_INVALID;
- serveDesign helper copying serveGoalSource;
- else-if branch immediately ABOVE the unconditional `else serveDocumentDossier`. Do not turn that else into a conditional.

Do not edit daemon-store-foundation-composition.ts, daemon-store-dependencies.ts, daemon-entry.ts, or daemon-entry-port-resolution.ts.

Re-run `pnpm --filter @moe/daemon test`. Step-2 reds go green. Quote Test Files N passed.
